nd the witnesses","transliteration":"wal-shuhadāi","verse_key":"39:69"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَقُضِىَ","en_gloss":"and it (will) be judged","transliteration":"waquḍiya","verse_key":"39:69"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَيْنَهُم","en_gloss":"between them","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"39:69"},{"pos":12,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"in truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"39:69"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"39:69"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"will not be wronged","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"39:69"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يُظْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"will not be wronged","transliteration":"yuẓ'lamūna","verse_key":"39:69"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٦٩","en_gloss":"(69)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:69"}]},{"verse_key":"39:70","surah":39,"ayah":70,"ar_uthmani":"وَوُفِّيَتْ كُلُّ نَفْسٍ مَّا عَمِلَتْ وَهُوَ أَعْلَمُ بِمَا يَفْعَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and every soul will be repaid in full for what it has done. He knows best what they do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَوُفِّيَتْ","en_gloss":"And (will) be paid in full","transliteration":"wawuffiyat","verse_key":"39:70"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كُلُّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kullu","verse_key":"39:70"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَفْسٍۢ","en_gloss":"soul","transliteration":"nafsin","verse_key":"39:70"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"39:70"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَمِلَتْ","en_gloss":"it did","transliteration":"ʿamilat","verse_key":"39:70"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"and He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"39:70"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"(is the) Best-Knower","transliteration":"aʿlamu","verse_key":"39:70"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"39:70"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَفْعَلُونَ","en_gloss":"they do","transliteration":"yafʿalūna","verse_key":"39:70"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٧٠","en_gloss":"(70)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"39:70"}]},{"verse_key":"39:71","surah":39,"ayah":71,"ar_uthmani":"وَسِيقَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوٓا۟ إِلَىٰ جَهَنَّمَ زُمَرًا ۖ حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَا جَآءُوهَا فُتِحَتْ أَبْوَٰبُهَا وَقَالَ لَهُمْ خَزَنَتُهَآ أَلَمْ يَأْتِكُمْ رُسُلٌ مِّنكُمْ يَتْلُونَ عَلَيْكُمْ ءَايَـٰتِ رَبِّكُمْ وَيُنذِرُونَكُمْ لِقَآءَ يَوْمِكُمْ هَـٰذَا ۚ قَالُوا۟ بَلَىٰ وَلَـٰكِنْ حَقَّتْ كَلِمَةُ ٱلْعَذَابِ عَلَى ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who rejected the Truth will be led to Hell in their throngs. When they arrive, its gates will open and its keepers will say to them, ‘Were you not sent your own messengers to recite the revelations of your Lord to you and warn you that you would meet this Day?’ and they will say, ‘Yes indeed we were.’ But the sentence of punishment will have been passed against those who rejected the truth.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَسِيقَ","en_gloss":"And (will) be driven","transliteration":"wasīqa","verse_key":"39:71"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"39:71"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَرُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"39:71"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"39:71"},{"pos":5,"ar":"جَهَنَّمَ","en_gloss":"Hell","transliteration":"jahannama","verse_key":"39:71"},{"pos":6,"ar":"زُمَرًا ۖ","en_gloss":"(in) groups","transliteration":"zumaran","verse_key":"39:71"},{"pos":7,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"39:71"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"39:71"},{"pos":9,"ar":"جَآءُوهَا","en_gloss":"they reach it","transliteration":"jāūhā","verse_key":"39:71"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فُتِحَتْ","en_gloss":"(will) be opened","transliteration":"futiḥat","verse_key":"39:71"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَبْوَٰبُهَا","en_gloss":"its gates","transliteration":"abwābuhā","verse_key":"39:71"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"and (will) say","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"39:71"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en